  "description": "This trigger event is sent by the placer application to the filler application to request anti-microbial device cycle data created during the decontamination/sterilization of medical supplies.  In the context of this message segment, the term 'device' refers to a sterilizer or a washer.  Sterilizers perform a sterilization process and washers perform a decontamination process.",
